# The laboratory contract runs these under bash on every platform, and the
# gate reads what bench prints byte for byte, so everything text stays LF.
# The corpus under tests/ is integer lists that bench parses, and the two
# files under tests/bad/ are refused because of their content, not their
# line endings, so they stay LF as well.
*.asm    text eol=lf
*.c      text eol=lf
*.h      text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.txt    text eol=lf
